# Vanilla: Expanded TODO List:
    ## Issues:
        Item-Slot Indicators:
            ☐ Perishable items freshness indicators should be able to optionally render as a horizontal bar.
            ☐ Perishable items freshness indicators should be able to optionally render as an outline around the item-slot.
            ☐ Food particle sim reacts too strongly to movement and is slightly too spongy.
            ☐ Food particles are too bright, need simple lighting approximation.
            ☐ Crucible metal particles are too bright, need simple lighting approximation.

        Radial Menus:
            ☐ Tool-mode radial menu needs to be able to be configured to allow interacting with the hotbar (e.g. for the chisel tools "add material" functionality).
            ☐ Reduce icon size for tool-mode radial menus.
            ☐ Increase center circle size for tool-mode radial menus.
            ☐ Implement mesh aware icon fitting for radial menus.

        Other:
            ☐ Fix respawn decal looking obnoxious (too colorful).

    ## New Features:
        ☐ Add HUD indicator to show current arrow type and quantity when player is holding a bow.
        ☐ Add HUD indicator for current approximate time of day (becomes less accurate the longer the player is away from the sun).
        ☐ Add HUD indicator for current weather conditions (e.g., rain, snow, fog).
        ☐ Add HUD indicator for outside temperature when approaching a level outside the players comfort zone.
        ☐ Add HUD indicator for player body temperature when approaching dangerous levels.
        ☐ Temporal gear amulets should provide information about when the next storm is expected to occur (approximately, with increasing accuracy as the storm gets closer).
        ☐ Wearing a temporal gear amulet should provide a subtle HUD indicator when a storm is approaching.
        ☐ Targeted items such as tools on toolracks have a subtle highlight to indicate that they are targeted.
        ☐ New "crafting menu" similar to minecraft: shows all craftable items with current inventory, allows searching. (Maybe this can just be added to the handbook?)

    ## Death Penalties:
        ☐ New death penalty option: lose *bag* items on death (items in inventory are lost, items on hotbar and equipped armor and weapons are kept).
        ☐ New death penalty option: lose *unequipped* items on death (items in inventory and hotbar are lost, equipped armor and weapons are kept).
        ☐ New death penalty option: lose *all* items on death (items in inventory, hotbar, equipped armor & weapons are lost).
        ☐ Tool degradation on death: all tools in inventory and hotbar lose <configurable percent> durability on death.

    ## Effects:
        ☐ Blocks with light level 1 have subtle haze/smoke particles (to indicate the edge of lit areas) (reuse the existing temporal storm ground particle effect).

# Vanilla: Rebalanced Ideas:
    Note: this is a different mod from Vanilla: Expanded, I'm just keeping the ideas list here for now.
    ## Recipes:
        ☐ Candles from animal fat (render fat into tallow -> tallow replaces wax in candle recipe).

    ## Monster Rebalancing:
        ☐ Monsters cant spawn under roofs.
        ☐ Increase gear drop rates from monsters (and trading costs for gears) by 500%. this will make fighting monsters feel more rewarding.
        ☐ Add other items to monster drops (bones, scrapmetal, metal parts (uncommon), gems (rare), etc) to make them more rewarding to fight.


